text @[Tomoya]
text Ryou...
text I call her name...
text Seemingly frightened, she bites her lips as her small shoulders tremble lightly.
text Seeing that, my composure suddenly slips.
text The words that I must say are stuck in my throat...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
