text @[Tomoya]
text ...The last three weeks... have been really fun...
text As I gently open my eyes, I start talking to her.
text @[Tomoya]
text You taught me how good it feels to be needed by someone...
text @[Tomoya]
text Everything that I saw... everything that I heard... and all that time we spent together...
text @[Tomoya]
text Every day felt so new...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Really...
text @[Tomoya]
text It's been... really fun.
text @[Tomoya]
text I thought it would be great if it kept going forever.
text @[Tomoya]
text No, rather... I thought we could keep it going forever.
text @[Tomoya]
text I thought that I could do well together with you...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...But I... came to notice...
text @[Tomoya]
text Through you... I noticed who I had my eyes on...
text @[Tomoya]
text I know what I am doing is truly terrible.
text @[Tomoya]
text I was spoiled.
text @[Tomoya]
text I was spoiled by how gentle you are and kept dragging it out...
text @[Tomoya]
text And all that time we spent together only served to hurt you.
text @[Tomoya]
text What I've done is mean and not fair.
text @[Tomoya]
text Because I didn't make it clear to you... you were hurt...
text @[Tomoya]
text While I was with you... while I was looking at you...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...I...
text The words get stuck in my throat.
text The most important thing... the one thing that I have to tell her wouldn't come out of my mouth...
text My lips tremble...
text I have to say it...
text Right now...
text I have to bring this to an end...
text @[Tomoya]
text Ryou... I'm sorry...
text @[Tomoya]
text The person that I like...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Is your...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text ......Sister...
music ~
text Ryou trembles...
text She bites hard on her lips, and, on the verge of tears, she looks at me...
music BGM18A.mp3
text @[Tomoya]
text ...I like Kyou...
