text Suddenly, I feel a powerful impact on my chest.
text Then, a briny sensation spreads throughout my mouth.
text Something wet and soft is pressed against my lips.
text For a moment, I can't figure out what is going on.
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKY09A"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s108
fi
goto 110
label s108
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 110
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
text Right in front of my eyes is a face laden with tears.
text Her eyes are tightly shut, causing tears to drip out and onto our overlapping lips.
text I can feel that there are strong, powerful feelings hidden in the kiss...
text And the taste is simply sad...
text @[Tomoya]
text Mm... mmph...! W-We can't!
text I pull my face back and turn away.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ryou! Stop! I... mmph!
text Her hands reach for my neck, and forcibly turns my head forward again.
text And she kisses once again.
text She's hugging me with all her might.
text She kisses me so roughly ─ violently, even ─ as if she's thrusting her feelings at me.
text Even so, I turn away.
text I reject the kiss that tastes of tears.
text @[Tomoya]
text Mmph... Ryou! We can't do this!
text @[Tomoya]
text It's Kyou whom I like!
text @[Tomoya]
text It's your sister!
text @[Tomoya]
text Every time I look at you, my head is only filled with Kyou!
text @[Tomoya]
text That's how truly terrible I am!
text @[Tomoya]
text Even if we stay together, it'll only hurt you!
text @[Tomoya]
text That's why─
