sound BI5.aac
text @[Voice]
text Tomoya...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Eh...?
text She called me by my name...
text And she squeezes her lips on mine once again.
text My mind turns blank.
text What... did she say just now...?
text What... did she call me...?
text Whose... voice was that...?
text Gently, the warm sensation leaves my lips.
text Finally, I can clearly see her tear-sodden face.
